t': 'Do I want Big Pharma held accountable? My mom was given DES (diethylstilbestriol) to prevent miscarriage, as she’d had one prior to my birth. She went on to have 3 more births without any drugs. At 15 (this was in the late 60s) I had to have my first pelvic exam because doctors had correlated cervical cancer in girls born to mothers given the drug. At 19, I was diagnosed with cervical cancer, and a month later had a hysterectomy just past my 20th birthday. The irony…I was not able to give birth because a doctor had prescribed a drug to supposedly help my mother give birth. They also gave this drug as a growth hormone to cows and pigs, but didn’t stop its use until 1979. So millions of people in my generation were exposed. Without their knowledge.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 2, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 31 14:49:18 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1885023470154596376', 'display_text_range': [14, 292], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '69156861', 'name': 'Chief Nerd', 'screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'indices': [0, 13]}]}, 'favorite_count': 13, 'favorited': False, 'full_text': '@TheChiefNerd Do I want Big Pharma held accountable? My mom was given DES (diethylstilbestriol) to prevent miscarriage, as she’d had one prior to my birth. She went on to have 3 more births without any drugs. At 15 (this was in the late 60s) I had to have my first pelvic exam because doctors', 'in_reply_to_screen_name': 'TheChiefNerd', 'in_reply_to_status_id_str': '1885023470154596376', 'in_reply_to_user_id_str': '69156861', 'is_quote_status': False, 'lang': 'en', 'quote_count': 0, 'reply_count': 2, 'retweet_count': 3, 'retweeted': False, 'user_id_str': '1796320516262748161', 'id_str': '1885339579919868110'}}, '_legacy': {'bookmark_count': 2, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 31 14:49:18 +0000 2025', 'conve